Triangle ABC with AB = 50 and AC = 10 has area 120. Let D be the midpoint of AB, and
let E be the midpoint of AC. The angle bisector of ∠BAC intersects DE and BC at F and G,
respectively. What is the area of quadrilateral FDBG?
